  "pitfalls": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "民國紀年",
        "en": "ROC calendar years"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "三成左右的資料集標題帶民國年，欄位裡的「114」是西元 2025 年；同一支 API 也可能民國、西元混用。",
        "en": "About three in ten dataset titles carry ROC years: \"114\" in a field means 2025. A single API can mix ROC and Gregorian dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "Big5 編碼",
        "en": "Big5 encoding"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "約一成資料集仍是 Big5 編碼的 CSV，直接用 UTF-8 打開會是亂碼，先轉碼。",
        "en": "About one dataset in ten is still a Big5-encoded CSV, which turns to gibberish if opened as UTF-8; convert it first."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "只給 PDF",
        "en": "PDF-only releases"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "1,187 個資料集只有 PDF，月報也常是 PDF；要用程式讀得先解析。",
        "en": "1,187 datasets exist only as PDFs, and monthly bulletins often are too, so they have to be parsed before use."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "平均數跟中位數",
        "en": "Mean versus median"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "薪資平均數會被高薪拉高，中位數才是一半的人賺得比這少的那條線；人力銀行的薪資調查跟主計總處口徑不同，不能直接比。",
        "en": "Average wages are pulled up by high earners; the median is the line half of workers fall below. Job-site salary surveys use a different basis from official statistics and cannot be compared directly."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "同一個數字有好幾個版本",
        "en": "One number, several versions"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "台灣人口在國際彙整站上能差到十幾萬人，因為各自用不同年份、不同推估。查台灣的數字，以發布它的台灣官方機關為準，並寫出期間。",
        "en": "International aggregators disagree on Taiwan's population by over a hundred thousand because they use different years and estimates. Use the Taiwanese agency that publishes the figure, and state the period."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "官方資料會消失",
        "en": "Official data can disappear"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "政府網站常只給即時值不留歷史，也會整批下架（疾管署 2026 年 8 月一次下架 234 個病例統計資料集）。用到的資料，記下取得日期與網址。",
        "en": "Government sites often show only the present and can withdraw data in bulk (in August 2026 the CDC pulled 234 case-statistics datasets at once). Record the date and URL of anything you use."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "授權要顯名",
        "en": "Attribution is mandatory"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "政府資料開放授權條款允許商業使用、與 CC BY 4.0 相容，但沒有標示原提供機關，就視為自始沒有取得授權。",
        "en": "Taiwan's open government data licence allows commercial use and is compatible with CC BY 4.0, but reuse without naming the original agency counts as never having been licensed."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh-TW": "國際資料庫可能沒有台灣",
        "en": "International databases may lack Taiwan"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh-TW": "世界銀行、WHO、UNESCO、UNDP 都沒有台灣這一列。用它們做國際比較時，台灣那一格要改用台灣官方統計，並註明來源不同。",
        "en": "The World Bank, WHO, UNESCO and UNDP have no Taiwan row. When comparing with them, fill Taiwan's cell from Taiwan's official statistics and note the different source."
      }
    }
  ],
